        "content": "## Image alt-text writer from image descriptions or file names\nList image file names and a short context in a sheet. The AI writes concise, accessible alt text for each.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "cce53d6a-2f2e-555f-bf53-58f5b942efce",
